# Glance service identity (fixed, in the preferred 0..199 packaged
# range): user glance UID 165, primary group glance GID 165.
# OpenStack services own the 164-170 block (164 keystone, 165 glance,
# 166 placement, 167-170 nova/neutron/cinder/horizon). Required
# by the shipped service units (systemd User=glance, OpenRC
# command_user glance:glance), glance-manage and the state/log
# directories. UID 165 is not reused by any other packaged identity.
user glance 165 glance /var/lib/glance /sbin/nologin
group glance 165
dir /var/lib/glance 0750 glance glance
dir /var/log/glance 0750 glance glance
